/* 🖐️ شريط يمشي لحاله ويتسحب باللمس — يكمل بسرعة الإصبع ثم يرجع لسرعته العادية بنعومة */
class Tape{
  constructor(wrap,inner){
    this.w=wrap; this.i=inner; this.x=0; this.v=0; this.auto=40; this.drag=false; this.hover=false;
    this.samples=[]; this.last=performance.now(); this.px=0; this.pt=0;
    const down=e=>{ if(e.button>0)return; this.drag=true; this.px=e.clientX; this.pt=performance.now();
      this.samples=[]; this.v=0; this.w.classList.add('drag'); try{this.w.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId)}catch(_){} };
    const move=e=>{ if(!this.drag)return; const now=performance.now(), dx=e.clientX-this.px, dt=Math.max(1,now-this.pt)/1000;
      this.x+=dx; this.px=e.clientX; this.pt=now; this.samples.push({v:dx/dt,t:now});
      if(this.samples.length>6)this.samples.shift(); this.wrapX(); this.apply(); };
    const up=()=>{ if(!this.drag)return; this.drag=false; this.w.classList.remove('drag');
      const now=performance.now(), s=this.samples.filter(q=>now-q.t<120);
      this.v=s.length?Math.max(-5000,Math.min(5000,s.reduce((a,q)=>a+q.v,0)/s.length)):0; };
    wrap.addEventListener('pointerdown',down); wrap.addEventListener('pointermove',move);
    wrap.addEventListener('pointerup',up); wrap.addEventListener('pointercancel',up);
    wrap.addEventListener('mouseenter',()=>{this.hover=true}); wrap.addEventListener('mouseleave',()=>{this.hover=false});
    const loop=now=>{ const dt=Math.min(0.1,Math.max(0,(now-this.last)/1000)); this.last=now;
      if(!this.drag){ const target=(this.hover||document.documentElement.classList.contains('lite'))?0:-this.auto;
        this.v+=(target-this.v)*(1-Math.exp(-dt*1.8)); this.x+=this.v*dt; this.wrapX(); this.apply(); }
      requestAnimationFrame(loop); };
    requestAnimationFrame(loop);
  }
  half(){return (this.i.scrollWidth||0)/2}
  wrapX(){const h=this.half(); if(h<=0)return; while(this.x<=-h)this.x+=h; while(this.x>0)this.x-=h}
  apply(){this.i.style.transform=`translate3d(${this.x.toFixed(2)}px,0,0)`}
  setLoop(sec){const h=this.half(); if(h>0)this.auto=h/Math.max(10,+sec||45)}
}
const TAPES={};

/* ⚡ أسعار لحظية: المتصفح يتصل مباشرة بقناة OKX العامة (بلا مفاتيح) — ولو انقطع يرجع لأسعار السيرفر */
const LIVE={ws:null,key:'',retry:0,last:{},ping:null};
function liveWS(coins){
  const key=(coins||[]).join(',');
  if(LIVE.key===key&&LIVE.ws&&LIVE.ws.readyState<=1)return;
  if(LIVE.ws){const o=LIVE.ws; LIVE.ws=null; try{o.close()}catch(e){}}
  clearInterval(LIVE.ping); LIVE.key=key;
  if(!coins||!coins.length||typeof WebSocket==='undefined')return;
  let ws; try{ws=new WebSocket('wss://ws.okx.com:8443/ws/v5/public')}catch(e){return}
  LIVE.ws=ws;
  ws.onopen=()=>{LIVE.retry=0;
    try{ws.send(JSON.stringify({op:'subscribe',args:coins.map(c=>({channel:'tickers',instId:c}))}))}catch(e){}
    LIVE.ping=setInterval(()=>{try{if(ws.readyState===1)ws.send('ping')}catch(e){}},25000)};
  ws.onmessage=ev=>{ if(ev.data==='pong')return; let m; try{m=JSON.parse(ev.data)}catch(e){return}
    (m.data||[]).forEach(d=>{const px=+d.last, o=+d.open24h; if(px>0)livePx(d.instId,px,o>0?(px-o)/o*100:0)})};
  ws.onclose=()=>{clearInterval(LIVE.ping);
    if(LIVE.ws===ws){LIVE.ws=null; LIVE.key='';
      setTimeout(()=>{if(document.hidden)return;const T=((DATA||{}).ticker||{}); liveWS(wsCoins(T.on?(T.coins||[]):[]))},Math.min(30000,2000*(++LIVE.retry)))}};
  ws.onerror=()=>{try{ws.close()}catch(e){}};
}
function livePx(sym,px,chg){
  const prev=LIVE.last[sym]; LIVE.last[sym]={px,chg,ts:Date.now()}; if(window.JPX)JPX[sym]=px;
  const sel=(window.CSS&&CSS.escape)?CSS.escape(sym):sym;
  document.querySelectorAll(`#tapein .tk[data-s="${sel}"]`).forEach(e=>{
    const p=e.querySelector('.tkp'), c=e.querySelector('.tkc'); if(!p||!c)return;
    p.textContent=fmtPx(px);
